      "sourceId": "src-f1eca77d61c58bea",
      "quote": "The goal of our laboratory is to define the molecular pathways necessary to maintain homeostasis in both the developing and aging nervous system. To do this we utilize both phenotype-driven forward genetics and gene-driven reverse genetics to identify mutations that are associated with abnormal CNS development or neurodegeneration.",
